{"seq":1,"slug":"collaborative-filtering","title":"协同过滤","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-recommendation-systems/rec-algorithms/collaborative-filtering","wordCount":868,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"协同过滤\">协同过滤</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>协同过滤（Collaborative Filtering, CF）是推荐系统中最经典的范式，其核心思想是利用用户群体的行为模式进行推荐。协同过滤基于一个假设：如果用户 A 和用户 B 在过去对相同的物品有相似的偏好，那么 A 在未来也可能喜欢 B 喜欢但 A 还没有接触过的物品。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 协同过滤分类&#10;        CF_ROOT[协同过滤] --&gt; MEMORY[基于记忆]&#10;        CF_ROOT --&gt; MODEL_CF[基于模型]&#10;        MEMORY --&gt; USER_CF[UserCF]&#10;        MEMORY --&gt; ITEM_CF[ItemCF]&#10;        MODEL_CF --&gt; MF_M[矩阵分解]&#10;        MODEL_CF --&gt; AE_M[自编码器]&#10;        MODEL_CF --&gt; GNN_CF[图神经网络]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 协同过滤分类\n        CF_ROOT[协同过滤] --&gt; MEMORY[基于记忆]\n        CF_ROOT --&gt; MODEL_CF[基于模型]\n        MEMORY --&gt; USER_CF[UserCF]\n        MEMORY --&gt; ITEM_CF[ItemCF]\n        MODEL_CF --&gt; MF_M[矩阵分解]\n        MODEL_CF --&gt; AE_M[自编码器]\n        MODEL_CF --&gt; GNN_CF[图神经网络]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>可扩展性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>UserCF</td>\n<td>相似用户推荐</td>\n<td>O(U²)</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>用户少、兴趣多变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ItemCF</td>\n<td>相似物品推荐</td>\n<td>O(I²)</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>物品少、稳定偏好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矩阵分解</td>\n<td>隐因子分解</td>\n<td>O(k(U+I))</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>通用场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SVD++</td>\n<td>MF + 隐式反馈</td>\n<td>O(k(U+I))</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>隐式反馈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ALS</td>\n<td>交替最小二乘</td>\n<td>O(k²(U+I))</td>\n<td>极好</td>\n<td>大规模稀疏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"基于记忆的协同过滤\">基于记忆的协同过滤</h2><p>UserCF 和 ItemCF 直接利用用户-物品交互矩阵中的相似性信息进行推荐，不需要训练模型参数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RatingMatrix {&#10;  users: string[];&#10;  items: string[];&#10;  ratings: Map&lt;string, Map&lt;string, number&gt;&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function userSimilarity(userId1: string, userId2: string, matrix: RatingMatrix): number {&#10;  const ratings1 = matrix.ratings.get(userId1) ?? new Map();&#10;  const ratings2 = matrix.ratings.get(userId2) ?? new Map();&#10;  const commonItems = [...ratings1.keys()].filter((item) =&gt; ratings2.has(item));&#10;&#10;  if (commonItems.length === 0) return 0;&#10;&#10;  let dotProduct = 0,&#10;    norm1 = 0,&#10;    norm2 = 0;&#10;  for (const item of commonItems) {&#10;    const r1 = ratings1.get(item)!;&#10;    const r2 = ratings2.get(item)!;&#10;    dotProduct += r1 * r2;&#10;    norm1 += r1 * r1;&#10;    norm2 += r2 * r2;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dotProduct / (Math.sqrt(norm1) * Math.sqrt(norm2) + 1e-8);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function userCFRecommend(&#10;  targetUser: string,&#10;  matrix: RatingMatrix,&#10;  topK: number,&#10;  numNeighbors: number = 20,&#10;): Array&lt;{ item: string; score: number }&gt; {&#10;  const similarities = matrix.users&#10;    .filter((u) =&gt; u !== targetUser)&#10;    .map((u) =&gt; ({ userId: u, sim: userSimilarity(targetUser, u, matrix) }))&#10;    .sort((a, b) =&gt; b.sim - a.sim)&#10;    .slice(0, numNeighbors);&#10;&#10;  const targetRated = matrix.ratings.get(targetUser) ?? new Map();&#10;  const scores = new Map&lt;string, number&gt;();&#10;  const simSums = new Map&lt;string, number&gt;();&#10;&#10;  for (const { userId, sim } of similarities) {&#10;    const neighborRatings = matrix.ratings.get(userId) ?? new Map();&#10;    for (const [item, rating] of neighborRatings) {&#10;      if (targetRated.has(item)) continue;&#10;      scores.set(item, (scores.get(item) ?? 0) + sim * rating);&#10;      simSums.set(item, (simSums.get(item) ?? 0) + Math.abs(sim));&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return [...scores.entries()]&#10;    .map(([item, score]) =&gt; ({ item, score: score / (simSums.get(item)! + 1e-8) }))&#10;    .sort((a, b) =&gt; b.score - a.score)&#10;    .slice(0, topK);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RatingMatrix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  users</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ratings</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> userSimilarity</span><span 