=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.userFactors.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> itemFactor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.itemFactors.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(itemId)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.latentDim; k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> uGrad</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> itemFactor[k] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> regularization </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userFactor[k];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> iGrad</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userFactor[k] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> regularization </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> itemFactor[k];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    userFactor[k] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> learningRate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uGrad;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    itemFactor[k] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> learningRate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> iGrad;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>BPR（Bayesian Personalized Ranking）是处理隐式反馈（点击/浏览，无显式评分）场景下的矩阵分解方法。它优化的目标是：对于用户交互过的物品应该排在未交互过的物品之前，而不是预测具体的评分值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐式反馈建模\">隐式反馈建模</h2><p>实际推荐系统中的用户反馈大多是隐式的（浏览、点击、购买），而非显式评分。隐式反馈的特点是只有正样本（用户交互过的物品），缺失数据既可能是用户不喜欢，也可能是用户没看到。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>正样本</th>\n<th>负样本</th>\n<th>优化目标</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pointwise</td>\n<td>交互=1</td>\n<td>采样=0</td>\n<td>二分类/回归</td>\n<td>WMF, iALS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pairwise</td>\n<td>交互物品</td>\n<td>未交互物品</td>\n<td>偏序关系</td>\n<td>BPR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Listwise</td>\n<td>排序列表</td>\n<td>列表级优化</td>\n<td>NDCG 近似</td>\n<td>ListRank-MF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对比学习</td>\n<td>正样本对</td>\n<td>负样本对</td>\n<td>InfoNCE</td>\n<td>SGL, SimGCL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>WMF（Weighted Matrix Factorization）为每个 user-item 对设置不同的权重：交互过的给高权重，未交互的给低权重。iALS（implicit Alternating Least Squares）是 WMF 的高效求解算法，通过交替固定用户/物品因子进行最小二乘优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>协同过滤是推荐系统的基石范式，利用群体行为模式发现个人可能的兴趣</li>\n<li>UserCF 适合兴趣多变的小规模场景，ItemCF 更稳定适合工业应用</li>\n<li>矩阵分解将用户和物品表示为隐因子向量，是协同过滤的核心方法</li>\n<li>隐式反馈建模（BPR、WMF）解决了实际场景中缺少显式评分的问题</li>\n<li>协同过滤的核心局限是冷启动和数据稀疏，需要与内容特征和知识图谱结合</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../collaborative-filtering/memory-based-cf\">基于记忆的协同过滤</a> —— 本篇 UserCF/ItemCF 部分的逐算法深入篇。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../collaborative-filtering/model-based-cf\">基于模型的协同过滤</a> —— 本篇矩阵分解与 BPR 部分的可运行实现详解。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"协同过滤","id":"协同过滤"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基于记忆的协同过滤","id":"基于记忆的协同过滤"},{"level":2,"text":"矩阵分解","id":"矩阵分解"},{"level":2,"text":"隐式反馈建模","id":"隐式反馈建模"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"LLM 增强推荐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-recommendation-systems/rec-applications/llm-enhanced-recommendation"},"next":{"title":"深度推荐模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-recommendation-systems/rec-algorithms/deep-rec-models"}}